== Studio's own setting wins over the toolkit ==
dark over a light desktop : classic-dark
light over a dark desktop : classic

== "system" asks the toolkit, and no ONE signal is enough ==
prefer-dark set         : classic-dark
theme NAME carries it   : classic-dark
only GTK_THEME does     : classic-dark
nothing says dark       : classic

== the three spellings of the same word ==
Adwaita-dark: true
Breeze-Dark:  true
Adwaita:dark: true
Breeze:       false

== an UNSET environment variable is not a string ==
is_string=false
dark=false

== the section tint follows the same decision ==
light: #eaf1fb
dark:  #2f3b4d
